# Recipe Share

## 1. Introduction
This repository contains the source code for the Recipe Share website, developed as our midterm project. The website is a fully responsive platform that allows users to view a gallery of dishes, read detailed cooking recipes, and learn about the chefs behind the meals. It is built strictly using HTML5, CSS3, Flexbox, CSS Grid, and the Bootstrap 5 framework to ensure proper layout across mobile, tablet, and desktop devices.

